vers a contradiction between the script of \"The Five Armored Warriors\" and reality. In the script, they are supposed to be killed by the White and Black Shining Emperors, but in reality, the two Shining Emperors are destroyed by them. Was the future where they were supposed to be defeated by the Shining Emperor a mistake on the part of the prophet? Or should the Shining Emperor not have been defeated?"},{"title":"Message - Un Cuore Smarrito","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3380","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1267","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1267","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"35993","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"70516","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"96084","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Message - Un Cuore Smarrito","synopsis":"While Suzunagi was lost in thought, Seiji appeared before her. Now that Seiji had realized everything, Suzunagi's bravado and false smile only seemed pitiful to him. Having seen through Seiji's heart, Suzunagi decided to reveal her true feelings as an illusion in order to show him the meaning of the grudge she was harboring!","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"While Suzunagi was lost in thought, Seiji appeared before her. Now that Seiji had realized everything, Suzunagi's bravado and false smile only seemed pitiful to him. Having seen through Seiji's heart, Suzunagi decided to reveal her true feelings as an illusion in order to show him the meaning of the grudge she was harboring!"},{"title":"Message - Una verità raggiunta","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3380","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1267","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1267","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"p